# Paths scripts/check-public.sh and scripts/publish-check.sh leave out (globs, one per line). Fix a false positive here only
# when the file must keep the text; prefer an invented value.
#
# Numbers the generic check reads as Fly.io machine ids (14 hex digits):
# the studio golden file's generated random edits and times,
internal/editspec/testdata/studio-ops.golden.json
# Go's pseudo-versions (a commit time and hash per dependency),
go.mod
# and whisper-server's recorded answer (word probabilities to 14 places).
internal/transcribe/testdata/whisper/zh.server.json
# Clip lengths the Windows run makes (330 … 1320 s), which read as a phone number.
scripts/windows-e2e.sh
# Homebrew on Linux has its own folder under /home: the one system folder there MetaRush names, kept in this file alone.
internal/tools/linuxbrew.go
